  "text": "## Extended Retention  \n**Retention Extended If:**\n- Customer dispute is active (until resolution + 6 years)\n- Regulatory investigation ongoing (until conclusion)\n- Legal action pending (until conclusion + 6 years)\n- Customer requests retention (must be documented)\n- Regulatory requirement (GDPR, POCA, etc.)  \n**Process:**\n1. Document placed on legal hold\n2. Marked \"Do Not Destroy\"\n3. Reassess annually\n4. Destroy when hold lifted  \n---",
